<p>NOTE: Lower fiscal 1997 net due to signing of the omnibus appropriations bill on Sept. 30, 1996, which imposed an FDIC special assessment for all institutions with SAIF-insured deposits. This assessment amounted to $776,717 and is included in other expense for the 12 months ended June 30, 1997. The after-tax effect on net income was $469,059 for the 12 months ended June 30, 1997.  SAIF-insured institutions, like the company, are also benefiting from a reduction of FDIC premiums beginning Jan. 1, 1997, which should have a positive effect on earnings in future periods.</p>
